# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform. Without this a
# Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF working-tree files,
# and `gofmt -l .` then flags every .go file as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries, should one ever be committed deliberately.
*.exe -text
*.png -text
*.jpg -text
